# BorrowCircle Frontend Environment Variables Example
# In production, if served by the same reverse proxy / monolith server, leave empty to default to '/api'
# If frontend is hosted separately (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages), point to backend URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api-staging.borrowcircle.in/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
